   "**What:** Function `format_summary` (grades.py:30) prints to the screen: on line 31 of `grades.py` it calls `print()`.\n\n**Why:** A function should return its result (`return`), not print it. Whoever calls it then decides what to do with the result; printed text can no longer be used by the program.\n\n**Fix:** Replace `print(...)` with `return ...` and print the result in `main`."
